{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_5_level_main_05-02_beg","groupId":"main_5","stageId":"main_05-02","title":"有口難言","storyCode":"5-2","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"fe830abcd011ca5fb7d711c18bd3e78cb2b2ac07db2e855ac590699d5774ce87","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"詩懷雅並不如她表現的那樣刻薄，但情況確實如她所說的糟糕。\n在一則機密通訊過後，陳決定請求羅德島的協助。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"詩懷雅，你沒有這個權力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"即使放下我們之間的私怨，我也不覺得你有這個能力來獲得這份任命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你甚至可以口頭聲明——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"“魏彥吾已向施警司發佈命令，即刻起，施警司將接管近衛局一切事務，並罷免現行動組長，予以撤職處分”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你能嗎？這條命令真的存在嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁......別這麼叫我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不能，就請你去完成自己的任務，現在接下這個燙手山芋對你沒有好處，“詩小姐”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"*龍門粗口*，說過多少次了，我不姓施！聽好，我的代號是詩懷雅，或者叫我碧翠克斯·施懷雅警官，懂嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你那套規矩關我*龍門粗口*，你這代號和姓氏，普通人聽了有誰知道區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"現在的我既沒時間也沒這個心情。請你讓開點，自己去找點事做，乖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"姓陳的......你可真是*龍門粗口*。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"祝你*龍門粗口*富貴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我走了，星熊。勸你管住這條瘋龍，她死在哪裡和我可是一點關係都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，抱歉，“小姐”。你們的脾氣其實都真夠差的。不管她怎麼說，剛才的援助還是謝謝你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"下次不會了，我要看著她血流不止。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"她的背怎麼了？像是新傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"她夾著你衝進了掩體，整合運動術師的法術在她背後三米的牆上炸開了花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"偶爾也對她好點，沒必要什麼時候都互相針對成這個樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"敲門聲"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可以進來嗎，龍門的陳長官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"進來吧。她不介意。不好意思，讓你久等了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有的事，不用見外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，陳長官。嗯......現在方便和羅德島這邊磋商一下任務內容嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經集結了數支小隊，他們正在甲板待命，準備好了隨時和你們一同出發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了，我馬上就去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉聽到了你和那位金髮警官之間的對話......我們知道近衛局損失慘重。你可以相信我們，羅德島能幫得上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......這不是我們現在該討論的話題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"別介意，星熊。你也很清楚詩懷雅在做什麼，她是在穩定局勢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"她火氣上頭，你也是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是順水推舟了一把。龍門損失慘重，這是“事實”，他們都應當知道的“事實”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"這不好，也不像是你會做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這是為了龍門。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說話更不像你了，你是探長，是高級警司，不是政客，逢場作戲從來都不是你的天職。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"這確實不是一個正規的警員該做的事，但我別無選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你太累了，需要好好放個假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"可能吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......我確實想過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊，我需要一次很長很長的休假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"等這次的事情結束以後就去吧，別死撐著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"黃城，或者春都？要嘛就花郡吧，黃城離這裡太遠了，花在路上的時間夠再休一次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"還是回維多利亞見見校友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我想去你的家鄉看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"別去，沒龍門有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"通訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......是機密頻道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"那我先出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_5_2_call"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請說，我在聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"陳sir......那些感染者，整合運動......到處都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"XR02？你在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"木禾倉庫。我中了幾箭，應該活不長了。這是陷阱......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等他們都走了你再來這裡。那個情報，我會留在身上。他們不會懂的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"代號XR02，你在那裡等著。近衛局會立刻趕過去。你手上的情報有時效性，我們必須拿到手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不確定，陳sir. 你有你的任務，我不想拖累你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"XR02，不准死。你必須活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我沒法說服你，陳sir. 你們要小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等，有動靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"【電流聲】"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"XR02？XR02！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"去整備隊伍吧，我們該走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_uptown_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"陳長官，你要出發了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島還剩下多少武裝力量？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這不在可交換情報裡，陳長官。我們接到的命令是輔助近衛局行動，但不能直接聽從你的調遣，長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像還沒提出這種要求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"抱、抱歉，多言了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事。我只是想詢問下羅德島的狀況，問問你們有沒有安全保衛上的難題，是否需要近衛局的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動多次被擊退，已經放棄進攻羅德島本艦了。從種種跡象來看，龍門的形勢要比羅德島嚴峻得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，這樣形容好像不太對......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，你們並不需要近衛局的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼暫時地，近衛局確實需要你們一點小小的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動封鎖了接泊區域的主幹道。我需要打開一個缺口。近衛局的時間不多，請各位爭分奪秒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"這是協議內容，長官，我們義不容辭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。跟我來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["詩懷雅"]}]}
